<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fluxnova-bpm-platform/INACTIVE> linkml:description "A newer version of the entry replaced it." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fluxnova-bpm-platform/INTERNALLY_TERMINATED> linkml:description "The process instance was ended from within, such as by a terminate end event." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fluxnova-bpm-platform/Information> linkml:description "The item is information." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fluxnova-bpm-platform/Mixed> linkml:description "The gateway both joins and splits." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fluxnova-bpm-platform/None> linkml:description "An event is thrown for each instance that completes." , "It has no direction." , "No arrow is drawn." , "The model does not say." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fluxnova-bpm-platform/One> linkml:description "An arrow points at the target." , "An event is thrown when the first instance completes." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fluxnova-bpm-platform/PENDING> linkml:description "The task was delegated and waits for the delegate to resolve it." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fluxnova-bpm-platform/Parallel> linkml:description "Each event starts an instance, or joins the one already started." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fluxnova-bpm-platform/Physical> linkml:description "The item is a physical thing." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fluxnova-bpm-platform/Private> linkml:description "The process is internal to its participant." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fluxnova-bpm-platform/Public> linkml:description "The process shows only what its participant exchanges with others." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fluxnova-bpm-platform/RESOLVED> linkml:description "The delegate resolved the task and handed it back to its owner." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fluxnova-bpm-platform/SUSPENDED> linkml:description "The process instance is suspended." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fluxnova-bpm-platform/Unspecified> linkml:description "The model does not say." .
